pace 1

## SQ-RP-07 | /solrp reset clears the Apple Pie food list and the Raspberry Pie diet cap
> forceload add 0 990 40 1010
> pbot spawn rp7 10 -60 1000 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 3
> zc4 hunger rp7 2
> zc4 eat rp7 minecraft:apple
> zc4 eat rp7 minecraft:bread
> zc4 eat rp7 minecraft:cooked_beef
> zc4 sol rp7
waitlog \[zc4\] sol rp7 20
> data get entity rp7 ForgeCaps
sleep 1
> solrp reset rp7
sleep 1
expect Reset the diet of 1 players
> zc4 sol rp7
> data get entity rp7 ForgeCaps
sleep 1
look ForgeCaps after the reset: Apple Pie food list foodsEaten 0, foodList [] and solrp_gateFoods []; solraspberrypie:diet maxDiversity 0, slots [], drinks []; zc4 sol counts 0 after (3 before)

## SQ-OB-07 | biscuits and gravy and glazed carrots pot recipes
> zq makes hearthandharvest:biscuits_and_gravy
waitlog \[zq\] done 20
> zq rdetail biscuits_and_gravy
waitlog \[zq\] done 20
> zq makes hearthandharvest:glazed_carrots
waitlog \[zq\] done 20
> zq rdetail glazed_carrots
waitlog \[zq\] done 20
> zq uses miners_delight:cave_carrot
waitlog \[zq\] done 20
look no shapeless (crafting_shapeless) biscuits recipe; one cooking pot recipe: any dough, raw sausage, salt, milk (bowl); glazed carrots pot recipe accepts cave carrot

## SQ-OB-08 | Street Corn: Fire Resistance 30 s plus Nourishment and Haste
> pbot spawn ob8 14 -60 1000 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 3
> effect clear ob8
> zq food hearthandharvest:street_corn
waitlog \[zq\] done 20
> zc4 hunger ob8 2
> zc4 eat ob8 hearthandharvest:street_corn
waitlog \[zc4\] eat ob8 20
> data get entity ob8 ActiveEffects
sleep 1
expect minecraft:fire_resistance|fire_resistance
look ActiveEffects: fire resistance 600 ticks plus Nourishment and Haste (zq food line lists the same)

## SQ-OB-10 | wooden buckets exist; one tree tapper recipe accepts either bucket; bucket from planks
> zq items creativedelight:wooden_
waitlog \[zq\] done 20
> give ob8 creativedelight:wooden_bucket
> give ob8 creativedelight:wooden_water_bucket
> give ob8 creativedelight:wooden_sap_bucket
> give ob8 creativedelight:wooden_milk_bucket
> give ob8 creativedelight:wooden_honey_bucket
sleep 1
count Gave 1\s+\[.*\] to ob8 >= 5
reject Unknown item
> zq makes hearthandharvest:tree_tapper
waitlog \[zq\] done 20
> zq rdetail tree_tapper
waitlog \[zq\] done 20
> zq makes creativedelight:wooden_bucket
waitlog \[zq\] done 20
bootreject \[creativedelight\].*(Exception|ERROR)
shell grep -cE "ERROR.*creativedelight|creativedelight.*Exception" logs/latest.log; true
look one tree tapper recipe, B slot accepts minecraft:bucket and creativedelight:wooden_bucket; a wooden bucket recipe from planks

## SQ-FDI-04 | eat out of each lunchbox tier: the food is tasted in both books, the lunchbox is not; one queue entry per bite
> pbot spawn fd4 18 -60 1000 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 3
> clear fd4
> zc4 sol fd4
waitlog \[zc4\] sol fd4 20
> zc4 hunger fd4 2
> zp9 lbfill fd4 solapplepie:lunchbag minecraft:cooked_beef 2
waitlog \[zp9\] done 20
> zp9 heldeat fd4
waitlog \[zp9\] done 20
> zc4 sol fd4 minecraft:cooked_beef
waitlog \[zc4\] sol fd4 20
> zc4 sol fd4 solapplepie:lunchbag
waitlog \[zc4\] sol fd4 20
> zc4 hunger fd4 2
> zp9 lbfill fd4 solapplepie:lunchbox minecraft:baked_potato 2
waitlog \[zp9\] done 20
> zp9 heldeat fd4
waitlog \[zp9\] done 20
> zc4 sol fd4 minecraft:baked_potato
waitlog \[zc4\] sol fd4 20
> zc4 sol fd4 solapplepie:lunchbox
waitlog \[zc4\] sol fd4 20
> zc4 hunger fd4 2
> zp9 lbfill fd4 solapplepie:golden_lunchbox minecraft:cookie 2
waitlog \[zp9\] done 20
> zp9 heldeat fd4
waitlog \[zp9\] done 20
> zc4 sol fd4 minecraft:cookie
waitlog \[zc4\] sol fd4 20
> zc4 sol fd4 solapplepie:golden_lunchbox
waitlog \[zc4\] sol fd4 20
> zc4 hunger fd4 2
> zp9 lbfill fd4 creativedelight:netherite_lunchbox minecraft:pumpkin_pie 2
waitlog \[zp9\] done 20
> zp9 heldeat fd4
waitlog \[zp9\] done 20
> zc4 sol fd4 minecraft:pumpkin_pie
waitlog \[zc4\] sol fd4 20
> zc4 sol fd4 creativedelight:netherite_lunchbox
waitlog \[zc4\] sol fd4 20
# a second bite of the same food: the queue grows by one, the tasted count does not
> zc4 hunger fd4 2
> zp9 heldeat fd4
waitlog \[zp9\] done 20
> zc4 sol fd4 minecraft:pumpkin_pie
waitlog \[zc4\] sol fd4 20
count \[zp9\] heldeat fd4 \S+lunch\S+ -> .* food= >= 5
count carrotHas=true applepieHas=true >= 4
reject \[zp9\] error|\[zc4\] .*error
look per box: the food line carrotHas=true applepieHas=true, the lunchbox line carrotHas=false applepieHas=false; carrot and applepie counts +1 per new food; applepieEntries +1 per bite (also the repeated pumpkin pie bite)

## SQ-FLR-02 | crushing wheels fed by a hopper: 200 flesh, then 200 porous flesh, outputs by pool
> forceload add 40190 39990 40270 40010
> execute unless block 40220 -58 40000 create:crushing_wheel run setblock 40220 -58 40000 create:crushing_wheel[axis=z]
> execute unless block 40222 -58 40000 create:crushing_wheel run setblock 40222 -58 40000 create:crushing_wheel[axis=z]
> execute unless block 40221 -58 40000 create:crushing_wheel_controller run setblock 40220 -58 39999 create:creative_motor[facing=south]{ScrollValue:128}
> execute unless block 40221 -58 40000 create:crushing_wheel_controller run setblock 40222 -58 40001 create:creative_motor[facing=north]{ScrollValue:128}
sleep 5
> execute unless block 40221 -58 40000 create:crushing_wheel_controller[valid=true] run setblock 40220 -58 39999 minecraft:air
> execute unless block 40221 -58 40000 create:crushing_wheel_controller[valid=true] run setblock 40222 -58 40001 minecraft:air
> execute unless block 40221 -58 40000 create:crushing_wheel_controller[valid=true] run setblock 40220 -58 40001 create:creative_motor[facing=north]{ScrollValue:128}
> execute unless block 40221 -58 40000 create:crushing_wheel_controller[valid=true] run setblock 40222 -58 39999 create:creative_motor[facing=south]{ScrollValue:128}
sleep 5
> execute if block 40221 -58 40000 create:crushing_wheel_controller[valid=true] run say FLR crusher valid ok
expect FLR crusher valid ok
