> zc4 put 40221 -57 40000 biomesoplenty:porous_flesh 64
> zc4 put 40221 -57 40000 biomesoplenty:porous_flesh 8
waitlog \[zc4\] put .* inserted=8 20
sleep 90
> zc4 inv 40221 -57 40000
> zc4 inv 40221 -58 40000
sleep 90
> zc4 inv 40221 -57 40000
> zc4 inv 40221 -58 40000
sleep 10
> zc4 pools 40221 -59 40000 -5
waitlog \[zc4\] pools 20
look first pools line (flesh): meat=200 exactly, bone near 150, eye near 50, misc near 50, other 0; second (porous): meat 275 to 325, eye=200 exactly, misc near 100, bone=0. Hopper and controller empty before each count (inv lines total=0)

